    "created_at": "2015-09-05T16:24:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-05T16:24:09Z",
    "body": "Right, if HTML made a \"cors\" fetch (using one of those modes) the result has to be either \"CORS-same-origin\" or a network error.\n",
